<title>USA: Homeplex holders approve Monterey merger.</title>
<headline>Homeplex holders approve Monterey merger.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Homeplex Mortgage Investments Corp said on Thursday its shareholders approved its proposed merger with Monterey Homes.</p>
<p>Homeplex announced plans to merge with Monterey, a group of privately held companies in Arizona, in June. Homeplex said it would issue about 3.6 million shares of its common stock in the deal, and options to buy up to another 1.2 million shares at $1.75 per share, it said.</p>
<p>The company said it expected the merger to close on December 31, and that the common stock would begin trading on a post split basis under the symbol MTH.N on January 2.</p>
</text>
